WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.267 --> 00:00:02.768
-Hey, guys.
We have some very exciting news.

00:00:02.768 --> 00:00:05.205
All next week
we have the biggest band

00:00:05.205 --> 00:00:08.274
in the world on the show -- BTS!

00:00:08.274 --> 00:00:09.475
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:09.475 --> 00:00:12.545
They're going to perform
a new song every night.

00:00:12.545 --> 00:00:13.980
We're going to be
talking to them.

00:00:13.980 --> 00:00:16.515
We got some fun games
planned, lots more.

00:00:16.515 --> 00:00:18.451
And we're kicking it all off
Monday night

00:00:18.451 --> 00:00:19.786
with a special
musical performance

00:00:19.786 --> 00:00:22.688
with BTS, me, and the Roots.

00:00:22.688 --> 00:00:24.691
[ Cheers and applause ]
Yeah.

00:00:24.691 --> 00:00:26.759
Let's just say
it's gonna be big.

00:00:26.759 --> 00:00:29.095
-Big.
-It's gonna be explosive.

00:00:29.095 --> 00:00:32.098
-[ Mimics explosion ]
-It's gonna be like TNT.

00:00:32.098 --> 00:00:33.432
-Boom!

00:00:33.432 --> 00:00:34.867
-It's gonna be...

00:00:34.867 --> 00:00:36.769
I can't think of any other
words, but it's gonna be big.

00:00:36.769 --> 00:00:38.905
So tune in every single night
next week.

00:00:38.905 --> 00:00:41.374
It's BTS week
on "The Tonight Show"!

00:00:41.374 --> 00:00:42.776
It's gonna be fun!

